+/// Extracts work-item ids from any WIQL response (Java `extractWorkItemIds`).
+///
+/// Flat queries answer with `workItems` stubs, returned in order. Link
+/// queries (`FROM WorkItemLinks`) answer with `workItemRelations`: each
